<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian five-week T-note yields 5.876 pct.</title>
<headline>Australian five-week T-note yields 5.876 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   5.876	 5.86-5.88   5.856</p>
<p>		 (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 59)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.813	 5.81-5.82   5.800</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 75)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.847	 5.81-5.85   5.805</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 38)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
